{"html": "<section class=\"panel investment-study\" id=\"case-pcb-comparison\"><p>对照单季利润、滚动现金流和资本开支，再用同期市值反推盈利门槛。</p><section class=\"panel investment-study pcb-peer\" id=\"chapter-section-18\"><h2 id=\"basics-pcb-p322\">深南电路与胜宏科技：谁把 AI 订单变成了利润和现金？</h2><p id=\"basics-pcb-p323\">截至 2026 年三季度，深南单季盈利较强，胜宏过去四季经营现金净流入较高。两家都在扩产。判断利润质量时，需要同时看回款、备料、给供应商的账期和已经付出去的设备款。</p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><thead><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p324\" scope=\"col\">2026Q3 · 集团口径</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p325\" scope=\"col\">深南电路</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p326\" scope=\"col\">胜宏科技</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p327\" scope=\"row\">收入</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p328\">104.78 亿元</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p329\">68.31 亿元</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p330\" scope=\"row\">毛利率</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p331\">34.85%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p332\">34.17%</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p333\" scope=\"row\">归母净利润</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p334\">18.78 亿元</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p335\">5.27 亿元</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p336\" scope=\"row\">扣非归母净利润</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p337\">18.58 亿元</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p338\">12.76 亿元</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p339\" scope=\"row\">滚动四季经营现金流</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p340\">34.83 亿元</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p341\">57.40 亿元</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id=\"basics-pcb-p342\">最大利润差出现在 2026 年三季度</h3><p id=\"basics-pcb-p343\">逐季比较归母净利润的绝对差，2026Q3 最大。深南比胜宏多赚 13.51 亿元，但扣非利润差只有 5.82 亿元。胜宏当季非经常性损益合计 −7.49 亿元，其中金融资产及负债公允价值变动和处置损益为 −6.90 亿元（税前项目）。胜宏当季归母净利同比下降 52.17%，扣非净利仍增长 16.16%。</p><p id=\"basics-pcb-p344\">再向上看毛利。两家当季收入相差 36.46 亿元。用胜宏的毛利率先算规模影响，约多出 12.46 亿元毛利；用深南收入乘两家毛利率差，再多出约 0.72 亿元。毛利的绝对差距主要由规模解释。期间费用、税费与非经常项目决定最后落到归母净利润的金额。</p><p class=\"source\" id=\"basics-pcb-p345\">资料　<a href=\"https://disc.static.szse.cn/download/disc/disk03/finalpage/2026-10-23/8d00fc48-5c09-45d6-b3c4-d1b794542e12.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深南三季报</a> · <a href=\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-10-30/1225644765.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">胜宏三季报</a></p><h3 id=\"basics-pcb-p346\">最大毛利率差却在 2025 年二季度</h3><p id=\"basics-pcb-p347\">当季胜宏 38.83%，深南 27.59%，相差 11.24 个百分点。胜宏 2025 年报披露全年 PCB 制造收入增长 79.92%，销售面积却下降 2.72%。按两项披露相除，每平方米对应收入约从 1,129 元升至 2,087 元，提示产品结构和单位面积价值值得优先检查。全年平均数无法识别某个料号在二季度的售价或良率。</p><p id=\"basics-pcb-p348\">作一个压力测试。假设同款、同价，所有制造成本都随投产发生，要只靠良率把毛利率从 27.59% 提到 38.83%，良率须变为原来的 (1−27.59%) ÷ (1−38.83%) ≈ 1.184 倍。起点若为 80%，终点约 94.7%；起点若为 90%，终点会超过 100%。两家公司产品组合不同，这个计算检验单一解释是否可行；实际良率仍待披露。</p><p class=\"source\" id=\"basics-pcb-p349\">资料　<a href=\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-03-13/1225007455.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">胜宏年报 · 销量与经营分析</a> · <a href=\"https://disc.static.szse.cn/disc/disk03/finalpage/2026-03-13/342c7f6b-cc0c-4592-9d25-9f95ae113d57.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深南年报 · 业务构成</a></p><h3 id=\"basics-pcb-p350\">从集团回到 PCB 业务</h3><p id=\"basics-pcb-p351\">深南的印制电路板业务和胜宏的半年报主营业务、年报 PCB 制造口径分别列出。季度表始终使用集团口径。半年和全年行用于比较同类报告期，金额为亿元。</p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><thead><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p352\" scope=\"col\">报告期</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p353\" scope=\"col\">深南 PCB 收入 / 毛利率</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p354\" scope=\"col\">胜宏收入及披露范围</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p355\" scope=\"row\">2024H1</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p356\">48.55 / 31.37%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p357\">45.49 · 半年报主营业务</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p358\" scope=\"row\">2024 全年</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p359\">104.94 / 31.62%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p360\">100.51 · PCB 制造</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p361\" scope=\"row\">2025H1</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p362\">62.74 / 34.42%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p363\">85.60 · 半年报主营业务</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p364\" scope=\"row\">2025 全年</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p365\">143.59 / 35.53%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p366\">180.84 · PCB 制造</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p367\" scope=\"row\">2026H1</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p368\">85.52 / 36.85%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p369\">108.39 · 半年报主营业务</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p id=\"basics-pcb-p370\">深南上半年封装基板业务单独贡献 36.67 亿元收入，毛利率同比提高 16.20 个百分点，公司提到广州工厂利用率提升。胜宏在 9 月调研中提到新厂转固折旧和人员培训储备带来的压力。这些披露支持两家公司处于不同的爬坡阶段；各因素贡献了多少个百分点，仍缺少分项数据。</p><p class=\"source\" id=\"basics-pcb-p371\">资料　<a href=\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2024-08-28/1221005673.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深南 2024 半年报</a> · <a href=\"https://disc.static.szse.cn/disc/disk03/finalpage/2025-03-12/0d7463e0-265e-48da-a684-a07eaa68a381.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深南 2024 年报</a> · <a href=\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-09-09/1225556001.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">深南业务说明</a> · <a href=\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2025-08-27/1224583516.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">胜宏 2025 半年报</a> · <a href=\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-08-28/1225522515.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">胜宏 2026 半年报</a> · <a href=\"https://static.cninfo.com.cn/finalpage/2026-09-15/1225566366.PDF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">胜宏 9 月问答</a></p><h3 id=\"basics-pcb-p372\">回款与扩产要放到同一张账上</h3><p id=\"basics-pcb-p373\">截至 2026Q3 的四季，深南经营现金流 34.83 亿元、资本开支 90.29 亿元，两者之差 −55.46 亿元；胜宏分别为 57.40 亿和 146.87 亿元，差额 −89.47 亿元。胜宏经营现金流较强，同时投入的现金也更多。该差额采用现金流量表的购建长期资产支出，是简化指标。</p><p id=\"basics-pcb-p374\">胜宏解释前三季度回款增加。同期其应付账款较年初增加约 45.02 亿元、期末存货增加约 60.87 亿元；一项延后付现，一项占用资金。深南期末存货较年初增长 88.72%，公司解释为业务扩张与备料。仅比较经营现金流/净利，无法拆出上述因素各自的贡献。</p><h3 id=\"basics-pcb-p375\">11 个季度的可复算底表</h3><p id=\"basics-pcb-p376\">金额为人民币亿元。流量按累计值相减还原单季；存货为季末余额。毛利率以单季收入减营业成本，再除以收入。滚动经营现金流含当季及此前三季。</p><details><summary>深南电路 · 展开 2024Q1—2026Q3</summary><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><thead><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p377\" scope=\"col\">季度</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p378\" scope=\"col\">营收</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p379\" scope=\"col\">毛利率</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p380\" scope=\"col\">归母净利</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p381\" scope=\"col\">扣非净利</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p382\" scope=\"col\">经营现金流</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p383\" scope=\"col\">近四季经营现金流</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p384\" scope=\"col\">期末存货</th><th id=\"basics-pcb-p385\" scope=\"col\">资本开支</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p386\" scope=\"row\">2024Q1</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p387\">39.61</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p388\">25.19%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p389\">3.80</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p390\">3.36</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p391\">5.63</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p392\">24.63</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p393\">27.48</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p394\">6.54</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p395\" scope=\"row\">2024Q2</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p396\">43.60</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p397\">27.11%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p398\">6.08</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p399\">5.69</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p400\">8.36</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p401\">27.68</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p402\">31.34</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p403\">6.17</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p404\" scope=\"row\">2024Q3</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p405\">47.28</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p406\">25.40%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p407\">5.01</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p408\">4.72</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p409\">2.65</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p410\">27.03</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p411\">35.03</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p412\">5.44</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p413\" scope=\"row\">2024Q4</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p414\">48.58</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p415\">21.95%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p416\">3.90</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p417\">3.64</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p418\">13.18</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p419\">29.82</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p420\">33.95</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p421\">7.12</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p422\" scope=\"row\">2025Q1</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p423\">47.83</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p424\">24.74%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p425\">4.91</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p426\">4.85</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p427\">6.13</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p428\">30.32</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p429\">36.71</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p430\">6.64</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p431\" scope=\"row\">2025Q2</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p432\">56.71</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p433\">27.59%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p434\">8.69</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p435\">7.80</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p436\">8.83</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p437\">30.79</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p438\">40.55</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p439\">8.82</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p440\" scope=\"row\">2025Q3</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p441\">63.01</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p442\">31.39%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p443\">9.66</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p444\">9.16</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p445\">8.19</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p446\">36.32</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p447\">46.88</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p448\">8.03</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p449\" scope=\"row\">2025Q4</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p450\">68.93</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p451\">28.59%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p452\">9.50</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p453\">9.32</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p454\">15.24</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p455\">38.38</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p456\">51.40</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p457\">14.16</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p458\" scope=\"row\">2026Q1</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p459\">65.96</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p460\">29.17%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p461\">8.50</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p462\">8.49</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p463\">2.47</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p464\">34.73</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p465\">65.01</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p466\">19.89</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p467\" scope=\"row\">2026Q2</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p468\">87.01</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p469\">32.41%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p470\">14.01</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p471\">13.90</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p472\">12.54</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p473\">38.45</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p474\">78.17</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p475\">26.90</td></tr><tr><th id=\"basics-pcb-p476\" scope=\"row\">2026Q3</th><td id=\"basics-pcb-p477\">104.78</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p478\">34.85%</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p479\">18.78</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p480\">18.58</td><td id=\"basics-pcb-p481\">4.57</td><td id